  Nodes:
  - NodeID: Start
    SpeakerName: Lan (Street Food Vendor)
    Text: Sometimes I wish I could be as carefree as Tuan Anh. He doesn't worry about
      a single thing in the world.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 1
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 1
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: "That\u2019s because his dad handles the worries, and you handle the reality,
      Lan."
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 2
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 3
    SpeakerName: Lan (Street Food Vendor)
    Text: Exactly. People call him names, but I think they're just jealous of his
      "freedom." He doesn't let the world weigh him down.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 4
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 4
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: "It\u2019s a nice way to look at it, even if it\u2019s a bit delusional."
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 5
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 5
    SpeakerName: Lan (Street Food Vendor)
    Text: In this town, you need a little delusion to get through the day!
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
